  "prefLabel": "Plc 1004.03 Examination Fees for Professions Regulated by the Board of Barbering, Cosmetology, and Esthetics",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1004.03 Examination Fees for Professions Regulated by the Board of Barbering, Cosmetology, and Esthetics. The examination fees for the professions regulated by the board of barbering, cosmetology, and esthetics under RSA 313-A shall be as follows:\n\n(a) The fees for barber examinations, equivalent to barber I examinations, shall be:\n\n(1) For the written exam, $88; and\n\n(2) For the practical exam, $99;\n\n(b) The fees for master barber examinations, equivalent to barber styling examinations, shall be:\n\n(1) For the written exam, $88; and\n\n(2) For the practical exam, $99;\n\n(c) The fees for cosmetologist, esthetician, or manicurist examinations shall be:\n\n(1) For the written exam, $88; and\n\n(2) For the practical exam, $99.\n\nSource. #14244, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 4-23-25; ss by #14377, eff 10-8-25, EXPIRES: 10-8-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1000.html"
